WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.310
In the spring of 1945,

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.730
a new Neuroi appeared in Venezian airspace.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.990
To meet this new threat,

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.240
two Fuso Witches, Miyafuji
Yoshika and Sakamoto Mio,

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.780
headed toward Europe.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.290
However, just moments
before they were to arrive,

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:23.750
a Neuroi appeared before
them, in full attack mode.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.410
Neuroi spotted, approximately
twelve thousand units out!

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.790
So they've already made it here?

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:40.680
Hijikata!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.220
Hijikata-san!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.770
<i>She's able to control
her magical power...</i>

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.900
<i>You've improved, Miyafuji.</i>

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.860
We need to run for cover!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.490
Drop altitude and ride it out!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:01.240
Roger.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.500
Sakamoto-san!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.790
Well? Do you think you can shake it off?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.960
I'll try...

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:13.920
Godspeed.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.290
Sakamoto-san!

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.880
Did you think I was gonna fight it?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.180
Calm yourself. We're fleeing for now.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.260
We'll wait for local Witches to back us up.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.140
Okay!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.060
Neuroi spotted dead ahead!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.150
All ships, approach for
battle at twenty-four knots!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.020
Set course for the enemy Neuroi!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.530
All ships, approach for
battle at twenty-four knots!

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.280
Aye!

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:39.990
Prepare for battle!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.990
Battle stations!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:58.800
Did you see how effective the
anti-large-type Neuroi incendiary was?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.130
Fire armor-piercing shells next!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.680
What are they doing?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.350
Fire armor-piercing shells!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.190
Did we get it?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.020
Amazing...

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.400
No good. They'll need much stronger
ammunition to take out a large-type Neuroi.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.280
Huh?

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.820
It's a large target, so it's easy to hit,

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.360
but that won't strike its core.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.700
They've sunk the destroyer.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:34.080
Where the hell are those
Romagna Witches?!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.250
Major! I sent a call for backup
to the Romagna 1st Airborne,

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.420
but they're saying we're
beyond their cruising range.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.550
Beyond their cruising range?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.430
They hit another one!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.140
They're too slow to dodge.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.260
They're sitting ducks out there!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:55.440
The 504th are nearby, but due to yesterday's
sortie, they're not combat-capable.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.980
We're looking, at minimum, a half an hour for backup Witches to arrive.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.820
A half an hour?!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:02.280
If this keeps up, they'll be
wiped out in five minutes!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.240
Wiped out?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.880
Do it, Hijikata!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:25.590
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.440
Major!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.240
Major, are you hurt?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:52.790
My shield can't deflect even
a tiny bullet anymore?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:53.910
Major...

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.920
How will it hold against a Neuroi beam?

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.560
Hijikata, I'm leaving to
travel for a while.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.390
I'm going in!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.100
Huh?

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.400
Roger that.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.480
Prepare for battle!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.320
Violet Lightning type-53
is ready when you are!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.740
You can't! Please stop!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.240
Move, Miyafuji!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.660
I'm not moving anywhere!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.410
You can't raise your shield anymore.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.120
I'm begging you. Don't go out there.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.750
I remember you stopping
me like this once before.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:47.010
Relax, Miyafuji. I'm not
going to die out here.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.420
But...

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:52.970
You're right, though... After I turned twenty, I lost the ability to use my shield.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.390
But I've got the new Violet Lightning unit,

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.060
and this sword here.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.230
You saved my life. I'm not
about to just throw it away.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.480
So relax, Miyafuji. I can fight.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.900
Then I have one request.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.650
Allow me to fight with you!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.660
Sounds good! Let's do this, Miyafuji!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:23.210
Miyafuji, go ahead and lead the Neuroi away from the Venezian fleet.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.170
I'll hit its core from the rear!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.250
Roger!

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.100
Fly, Miyafuji!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.600
Here I go!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.780
Sakamoto-san!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.820
They only got the launch unit.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.570
Look out ahead! The next beam is incoming!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.580
My god...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.660
What a huge shield!

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.040
That's her power at work.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.500
Major! The magic supercharger malfunctioned!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.630
The Violet Lightning cannot take flight!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.800
What?!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.380
Food! Food!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.220
Supplies! Supplies!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.970
Fuso rice!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.680
Steamy, fresh rice!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.060
Carpaccio!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.310
Made with octopus!

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.520
Ugh... I was with you until "octopus."

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.060
Huh? But octopus is so delicious.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:31.360
It's so squirmy... I dunno how you can eat it.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:36.820
Squirmy, stretchy, and sticky... So good.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.620
I'll take your word for it.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.370
All troops in the area...

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.330
This is the Venezian 1st Battle Fleet.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:48.340
We are currently engaging a Neuroi.
Requesting backup immediately.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.090
Present coordinates...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.590
Did you hear that? Let's go, Lucchini!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.970
Roger!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.010
It's too dangerous, Major!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.770
You should wait for us to finish
the Violet Lightning's repairs!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:05.440
How many casualties do you think they'll
suffer while we wait for the repairs?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.980
Looks like Miyafuji is wearing off on me.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.990
Destroyer Venier has taken severe damage!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.990
The engine is losing power at a rapid pace!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.240
She'll be stranded within minutes!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.530
Damn it... Isn't there something we can do?

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.660
Captain! It's a Witch!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.500
What?

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.470
Her crest has a sun and
moon atop white...

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.470
She's a Fuso Witch!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.510
Fuso?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.810
A Witch! A Witch is here!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:41.850
Reinforcements have arrived!

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.680
Which unit is she with?

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.270
Just incredible.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.780
You escape, while I lead the Neuroi away!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.780
Out of the question. We can't leave you to do battle alone.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.490
Captain, we've depleted our firepower.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.750
You're right. We'd just get in her way.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.040
All ships set course for sixteen degrees!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.040
Full-speed retreat!

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:17.590
Thank goodness.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.390
Get out of here, quickly.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.560
Sakamoto-san!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:29.100
Hijikata, take me straight in!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.060
Roger!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:44.870
That's too dangerous!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.960
Sakamoto-san!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:56.460
<i>Death strike,</i>

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.760
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.150
Sakamoto-san!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.450
Sorry, Miyafuji.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.330
The Violet Lightning malfunctioned.
I should have gotten here sooner.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.330
I told you not to do anything crazy!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.790
See? What did I tell you?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.290
Even without a shield, I can still fight.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.130
As long as I have my Reppumaru.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:43.090
<i>She's amazing... Sakamoto-san
is such an amazing person.</i>

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:48.810
By the way, Miyafuji, what do you
think of the name "Reppumaru"?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.440
I spent all night thinking it up.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.230
Huh? I-I think it sounds cool.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.320
Really? You think it's cool? Nice!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.610
Shirley, look!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:04.620
Yeah... Pieces of the Neuroi.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.660
I bet the Venezian fleet destroyed it.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.540
Go them!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.080
Yeah... But I'm still detecting a Neuroi presence.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.130
So you think there are more of them?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.970
Excellent work, Major.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.340
We didn't even need to
deploy the Violet Lightning.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.430
That was a little too easy.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.020
Huh?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:34.270
You just feel that way
because you're so strong now.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.650
I hope that's what it is.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.620
Sakamoto-san!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.950
The Neuroi is regenerating!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.140
This can't be... The core is still alive.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.060
I'm going in!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.270
Miyafuji, the core is
regenerating it along the edge.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.860
Break through and kill it!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.020
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:27.490
What?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.660
I see. So that's how it works.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.330
Miyafuji! Its core is moving!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.620
It's over to the right now.
Don't let it escape!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.830
Huh? O-Okay!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.170
<i>Damn, it's dodging the bullets.</i>

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.630
<i>I've never seen such speedy regeneration. This is bad!</i>

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:50.140
Miyafuji! The core is moving
right before the bullets hit.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.220
We need to launch
multiple rounds at once!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.220
Multiple rounds at once?

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.270
You can't do it by yourself.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.980
Hold on. I'll join you!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.770
How's the Violet Lightning coming?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.690
I need five more minutes.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.480
All I need it to do is fly.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.860
You have three minutes!

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.030
Sakamoto-san!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.790
This is bad... Miyafuji's magic
power is at its limit.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:24.380
<i>I-I can't keep this shield up forever!</i>

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:32.810
Miyafuji!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.680
You can't do it alone! Miyafuji!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.730
I see it!

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.570
Hold on!

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.490
Miyafuji, behind you!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.370
Miyafuji!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.970
I-I need to raise a shield...

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:16.470
No way!

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:18.520
Yoo-hoo!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.190
Shirley-san!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.520
Ciao, Yoshika!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.900
Lucchini-chan!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.610
Did you see that? We scored nothing but direct hits!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.580
What the heck is with this
Neuroi? It's hard as a rock!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.080
Shirley-san, Lucchini-chan,
what are you guys doing here?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.120
I wanna know what
<i>you're</i> doing here!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.170
Save the small talk for later!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:46.340
What gives? Those shots didn't kill it?

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.170
It regenerates very quickly.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.170
Guess we need more firepower.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.510
An armor-piercing rifle!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.890
That means...

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.390
Lynne-chan!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.100
Yoshika-chan!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.400
Lynne-chan!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.780
You're safe. I'm so glad.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.280
Yeah. I just came in from Gallia.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:15.280
No time for greetings, girls.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.030
Perrine-san!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.920
Rockets?

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:23.540
Look!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.840
Eila-san!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.340
Sanya-chan!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.720
The gang's back together!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.260
All right, I'll go in first.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:33.680
Okay.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.190
They came...

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.650
Still fixing it?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.770
One more minute!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.780
The enemy Neuroi is a mobile core -type.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.610
It regenerates at twice the
speed of a normal Neuroi.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.780
We just need to destroy it
faster than it regenerates.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:59.790
Man, looks like my time
off with Chris is over.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.160
You said you'd be the first
one back in action.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.040
Hey-

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.540
I'm going ahead.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.580
W-Wait up!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:07.670
Is that them?

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.800
It's the three of them!

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.300
Commander Minna!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.510
Barkhorn-san!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.010
Hartmann-san!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.640
Spread out, left to right.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.470
Roger!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.680
Lieutenant Colonel Minna,
hold nothing back!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.810
Understood.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.520
Caesar formation.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.480
Roger!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.360
Major, Violet Lightning ready for flight!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.230
Okay!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.160
Engine output normal!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.990
Sakamoto Mio, heading into battle!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.330
Commence attack!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:37.760
Take this!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.510
The core's isolated!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:43.850
I'll get it!

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.390
Sakamoto-san!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.190
Mio!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:49.390
I don't need any help!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.190
What's with the agility?

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.690
She's dodging every attack.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.190
She looks like Eila.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.070
Oh no! It's going to hit her!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.160
Major!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.570
Slice it to pieces, Reppumaru!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.660
Take this...

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.830
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.380
Amazing...

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.720
She got it in one shot!
Yay!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.760
Yay!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.930
Ah, Major! You're the best!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.310
I've never seen someone cut
a Neuroi beam before.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.810
Maybe no one's ever tried.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.360
There's nothing a Witch can't do!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.740
So those are the Strike Witches...

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:48.540
Huh? The same Witch corps
that liberated Gallia?

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.210
Yes, the 501st Joint Fighter Wing.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:57.050
The legendary Witches have
descended upon the Adriatic Sea.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.100
Yoshika-chan!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.850
Lynne-chan, I'm so glad you're okay!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.650
I can't believe you came all the way here.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.400
I wouldn't have expected
you to be here, Miyafuji.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.900
Aren't you guys supposed to
be in Africa, Shirley-san?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.780
We were worried about
Romagna, so we came here!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:29.540
Well, we're supposed to be on
the way to Suomus right now,

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.330
but we got on the wrong train
and ended up in the Adriatic.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.920
Eila's tarot cards said there'd
be something dangerous here.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.800
What an incredible sword...

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.090
Reppumaru.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:44.010
I painstakingly forged it
myself, filling it with magic.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:49.430
By mastering blade spells, the sword
has become a new shield of sorts for me.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.890
Isn't that a bit dangerous, though?

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:57.810
I just want to fly...
like you-know-who.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.820
I guess you have no plans to stay grounded.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.320
None whatsoever.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.820
Okay, then.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:14.710
I will now read you
official orders from SCAP.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.670
Now that the members of
the old 501st have returned,

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:21.710
you are to intercept and destroy the
new Neuroi which have invaded Romagna

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.880
via the Adriatic Sea.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.300
We will be sending you the
materials and items you need.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:31.520
But for now, negotiate with the
local commanders for them.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:37.440
Good job getting those orders.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.520
Major General Galland
signed the letter herself.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.240
More like she was forced to sign it.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.450
Where's your respect, Hartmann?

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:48.450
Whatever you think about it,
an order is an order.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:49.870
Whatever.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.120
Hey, Lynne-chan, what does this mean?

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.370
Um...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.710
I am Lieutenant Colonel
Minna Wilcke. Below me are:

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.210
Major Sakamoto Mio.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:05.220
Captain Gertrud Barkhorn.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:07.720
Captain Charlotte Yeager.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.220
First Lieutenant Erica Hartmann.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.720
First Lieutenant Sanya Litvyak.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.230
First Lieutenant Perrine Clostermann.

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:18.230
First Lieutenant Eila Ilmatar Juutilainen.

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:21.060
Ensign Francesca Lucchini.

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:23.570
Master Sergeant Lynette Bishop.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:26.070
Sergeant Miyafuji Yoshika.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:34.290
Here, today, we reform the
501st Joint Fighter Wing,

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:36.710
the Strike Witches!

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:38.000
Roger!

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:14.340
Welcome back, Yoshika-chan.
We get to spend time together again.

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.930
Huh? Training?

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:18.010
Yoshika-chan, w-wait!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:22.270
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2:</i>
What We Can Do Together.

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:23.650
Ah, no!
